</li>
<li class=3D"css-b0qdn7">
<p class=3D"css-1mglt86">Perform various operations on the mail app using u=
seReducer.</p>
<ul class=3D"css-1rzk253">
<li class=3D"css-b0qdn7">
<p class=3D"css-1mglt86">Implement filters to show unread emails and to sho=
