</li>
<li class=3D"css-b0qdn7">
<p class=3D"css-1mglt86">Delete an email: The email should be sent to the T=
rash folder if you delete
an email.</p>
</li>
<li class=3D"css-b0qdn7">
<p class=3D"css-1mglt86">Mark an email as read: This should decrease value =
of the =E2=80=9CUnread=E2=80=9D counter.</p>
</li>
<li class=3D"css-b0qdn7">
